 **[Kalidou Ba]()** is a PhD student in Biostatistics at [Inserm U1219 *Bordeaux Population Health*](https://www.bordeaux-population-health.center/) in the [SISTM team](https://www.bordeaux-population-health.center/the-teams/sistm/). His PhD focuses on the development of new methods for cellular composition prediction from longitudinal transcriptomics data in vaccine trials. He is supervized by [Boris Hejblum](https://borishejblum.science) and [Xavier Hinaut](https://sites.google.com/site/xavierhinaut/)
